        <briefdescription>
<para>Marker shapes drawn by series with a <computeroutput>marker</computeroutput> grouped property, such as <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1LineCurve" kindref="compound">LineCurve</ref></computeroutput> and <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1PointCloud" kindref="compound">PointCloud</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Every shape except <computeroutput>Pixel</computeroutput> fits within a square whose half-width is the marker size. The shaders select a shape by this value minus one, so append new shapes at the end and never reorder or insert. Series that always draw markers, such as <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1PointCloud" kindref="compound">PointCloud</ref></computeroutput>, do not accept <computeroutput>None</computeroutput>. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
